@startuml
title Sequence diagram: equipment requests
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' People work in the Web App, which calls the Backend API with their login token, so
' every call and its answer is two arrows: person <-> Web App, Web App <-> Backend API.
' Only the arrows to and from the Backend API and PostgreSQL are numbered, as in the
' draw.io and PDF versions.
' A notification is a record saved in PostgreSQL. Nothing is pushed to its recipient
' (no email, websocket or polling): the Web App fetches it later with
' GET /api/notifications, as the last section shows.

actor "Event\nCoordinator" as coordinator
actor "Technical\nSupport Staff" as support
participant "Web App\n(React)" as web
participant "Backend API" as api
database "PostgreSQL" as db

== Equipment request (the event must be Approved or in Safety Review) ==
coordinator -> web : Add an equipment line
autonumber
web -> api : POST /api/events/requests/:reference/equipment
api -> db : Add equipment line (requested)
api -> db : Save notification:\nTechnical Support
api --> web : The new line (requested)
autonumber stop
web --> coordinator : Show the line

support -> web : Check availability
autonumber resume
web -> api : GET /api/equipment/events/:reference/availability
api --> web : Free units per type for the event's period
autonumber stop
web --> support : Show availability

support -> web : Reserve equipment
autonumber resume
web -> api : POST /api/equipment/events/:reference/reservations
api -> db : Reserved units are no longer\nfree for overlapping events
api --> web : The reservation
autonumber stop
web --> support : Show the reservation

support -> web : Record the outcome
autonumber resume
web -> api : POST /api/events/requests/:reference/\nequipment/:line_id/outcome
api -> db : Line becomes fulfilled,\npartially fulfilled\nor unavailable
api -> db : Save notification: coordinator
api --> web : The line, with its outcome
autonumber stop
web --> support : Show the outcome

== Later, the Web App fetches each recipient's saved notifications (nothing is pushed) ==
support -> web : Open notifications
autonumber resume
web -> api : GET /api/notifications
api --> web : Equipment requested for an event
autonumber stop
web --> support : Show notifications

coordinator -> web : Open notifications
autonumber resume
web -> api : GET /api/notifications
api --> web : The equipment outcome and its note
autonumber stop
web --> coordinator : Show notifications
@enduml
